% ====================================================
% REPEAT — Isaiah 56:4–8
% Source: black ink, photo 43 (PXL_20261105_235833638.jpg)
% Compare with: Isaiah/56.tex (blue ink, photo 41)
% ====================================================
  \pb \verse{56:4} For thus says the \lord,%%

  \pc ``To the eunuchs who keep\alt{observe} My Sabbaths%%

  \pc and choose the things that\alt{what} please Me\pa and hold fast to My covenant,%%

  \pb \verse{56:5} I will give to them a memorial and a name in My house and in My walls\pa better than sons and daughters.%
  \ed{not ``better than that of sons and daughters''}%%

  \pc I will give them an everlasting name\pa that shall not be cut off.%%

  \pb \verse{56:6} And foreigners' children who bind themselves to the \lord%%

  \pc to serve Him and to love the name of the \lord,\pa to be His servants,%%

  \pc everyone who keeps from profaning the Sabbath\pa and holds fast to My covenant,%%

  \pb \verse{56:7} I will bring them to My holy mountain\pa and cause them to rejoice in My house of prayer.%%

  \pc Their burnt offerings and sacrifices shall be accepted on My altar,%%

  \pc for My house shall be a house of prayer to all people.''%%

  \pb \verse{56:8} A declaration of the Lord \god,%
  \ed{\Hebrew{אדני יהוה}}
  \pa who gathers the outcasts of Israel,%%

  \pc ``Again I will gather to Him with those already gathered.''%%
